            "review_title": "Review at Pho Hien",
            "review_text": "Mervyn33\nSingapore, Singapore353 contributions\n0\nAnother great Pho restaurant\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nThis trip was to try out new foods joint, instead of Pho Hung or Pho Vietnam, Mr friend recommended me Pho Hien 1985.\nWhen I was there, I didn’t see any foreigner except me.\nI had the beef pho, it was great comparable to Pho Hung but slightly tastier. I also have an egg in beef broth, to be eaten in one go was delicious. \nPho Hung has more beef varieties. Definitely, can come back again\nRead more\nWritten February 23, 2025",
