            "review_text": "han l\nSingapore, Singapore185 contributions\n0\nBudget noodles\nDec 2017 • Friends\nThe beef soup, tendon and slices are nice. Environment is clean and air-con.\nMenu is user-friendly. \n\nThe noodle portion is decent if u choose the large bowl. \n\n-btw, we tried pho hung, pho hien and pho le on the same street- \n\nPlease refer to the rest for comparison.\n\nNoodles - 8/10\nBeef slices - 8/10\nBeef tendon - 5/10\nBone marrow - 8/10\nMeatball - 6/10\nSoup - 7/10 (abit light)\n\nOur favourite is pho le on the same street!\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2017",
