            "review_text": "Hambeary\nSingapore, Singapore139 contributions\n0\nThe cleanest pho restaurant!\nAug 2017 • Friends\nIt was an accidental, but I'm absolutely delighted at this new find.\n\nThe cleanest pho restaurant I've come across so far. Nice quiet modern ambience and nice cool air-conditioning.\n\nMenu is simple and straight forward. Pictures with labels on the wall make it easy to order. They come in handy as the service staff can't speak a word of English.\n\nBroth is light but flavourful. I really like that they poached the sprouts lightly before serving.\n\nThe blood is the nicest I've had by far in HCM! If you haven't tried it, you should! The texture is like that of egg whites, but it has the richness of fresh beef like the taste of juices from a steak, perfect when immersed in a nice clean beef broth, yums!\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2017",
